  concept: 'Authored objective: Preserve essential power through eclipse.

    Authored
    requirement: Verify energy balance, reserve, load shedding and sunrise recharge.

    General
    teaching principle: Electrical measurements are differences or flows that require
    a correct reference, operating condition and fresh solver evidence.

    Only
    fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: A pressure gauge needs a reference; a voltage measurement likewise depends
    on its defined points.
